Q15. Jenkins CI/CD pipeline troubleshooting
Scenario:

Your Jenkins pipeline has these stages:
1. Checkout code from GitHub.
2. Build Docker image.
3. Push image to Docker Hub.
4. Deploy application to EKS.
The first three stages succeed, but the Deploy stage fails.

Answer these five questions:
